  "nsfw": false,
  "description": "Model format: int8 ConvRot. Steps: 8 by default.\n\nOliviaRossi's PRISM merge of Singularity v2 and 10Eros Max, the plain merge without DMAD/PDMD or Pika built in (those are the PRISM DMAD PDMD and PRISM-PIKA packs). Realistic skin with no extra LoRA. Text, image and reference to video from one 18.9 GB file, with nothing to install. It downloads from Hugging Face, so no Civitai key is needed. Eight steps by default on er_sde, beta scheduler and shift 6/3 (no CFG), the settings a user runs it on in ComfyUI. Checked 2026-11-18 on a 12 GB RTX 4070 Ti. In reference to video the person stays recognisable, but a close-up picture of an object in its setting does not bring the setting with it: give it a wide picture of the whole place. Works with the app's Faster Attention toggle.",
